{"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLSwing","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/ivormxl\/mxlswing"]}],"topicSections":[{"title":"Initializers","identifiers":["doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLSwing\/init(content:style:)"],"generated":true,"anchor":"Initializers"},{"title":"Instance Properties","identifiers":["doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLSwing\/content-swift.property","doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLSwing\/style"],"generated":true,"anchor":"Instance-Properties"},{"title":"Enumerations","identifiers":["doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLSwing\/Content-swift.enum","doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLSwing\/Kind"],"generated":true,"anchor":"Enumerations"},{"title":"Default Implementations","identifiers":["doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLSwing\/Equatable-Implementations"],"generated":true,"anchor":"Default-Implementations"}],"metadata":{"symbolKind":"struct","roleHeading":"Structure","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"MXLSwing","kind":"identifier"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"MXLSwing"}],"title":"MXLSwing","externalID":"s:7IvorMXL8MXLSwingV","modules":[{"name":"IvorMXL"}]},"kind":"symbol","hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL"]]},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The swing element specifies whether or not to use swing playback, where consecutive on-beat \/ off-beat eighth"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"or 16th notes are played with unequal nominal durations."}],"sections":[],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"patch":0,"minor":3},"relationshipsSections":[{"title":"Conforms To","identifiers":["doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/s8CopyableP","doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/SQ","doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/s9EscapableP","doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/SH","doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/s16SendableMetatypeP"],"kind":"relationships","type":"conformsTo"}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"MXLSwing","kind":"identifier"}],"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swift"]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"text":"Overview","anchor":"overview","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The straight element specifies that no swing is present, so consecutive notes have equal durations.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The first and second elements are positive integers that specify the ratio between durations of consecutive","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"notes. For example, a first element with a value of 2 and a second element with a value of 1 applied to eighth","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"notes specifies a quarter note \/ eighth note tuplet playback, where the first note is twice as long as the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"second note. Ratios should be specified with the smallest integers possible. For example, a ratio of 6 to 4","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"should be specified as 3 to 2 instead.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The optional swing-type element specifies the note type, either eighth or 16th, to which the ratio is applied.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"The value is eighth if this element is not present.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The optional swing-style element is a string describing the style of swing used.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The swing element has no effect for playback of grace notes, notes where a type element is not present, and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"notes where the specified duration is different than the nominal value associated with the specified type. If","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"a swung note has attack and release attributes, those values modify the swung playback.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Maps the MusicXML ","type":"text"},{"code":"<swing>","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" element.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"references":{"doc://IvorMXL/s8CopyableP":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/s8CopyableP","title":"Swift.Copyable","type":"unresolvable"},"doc://IvorMXL/documentation/IvorMXL/MXLSwing":{"fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"MXLSwing","kind":"identifier"}],"type":"topic","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"MXLSwing"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The swing element specifies whether or not to use swing playback, where consecutive on-beat \/ off-beat eighth"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"or 16th notes are played with unequal nominal durations."}],"url":"\/documentation\/ivormxl\/mxlswing","title":"MXLSwing","role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLSwing","kind":"symbol"},"doc://IvorMXL/s16SendableMetatypeP":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/s16SendableMetatypeP","title":"Swift.SendableMetatype","type":"unresolvable"},"doc://IvorMXL/documentation/IvorMXL/MXLSwing/content-swift.property":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLSwing\/content-swift.property","url":"\/documentation\/ivormxl\/mxlswing\/content-swift.property","title":"content","type":"topic","kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"One of the alternatives for Swing."}],"role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"let","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"content","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:7IvorMXL8MXLSwingV7ContentO","text":"Content","kind":"typeIdentifier"}]},"doc://IvorMXL/documentation/IvorMXL/MXLSwing/Content-swift.enum":{"role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/ivormxl\/mxlswing\/content-swif